pan></a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-media\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-media-inner grve-radius-none grve-shadow-none\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-background-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-bg-image lazyload\" data-bgset=\"https://staticfile.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/gutenberg-editor-wordpress-handwriting.webp 1024w, https://staticfile.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/gutenberg-editor-wordpress-handwriting-768x447.webp 768w\" data-sizes=\"auto\"></div>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-date grve-h5 grve-heading-color\">\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2025-05-18T15:09:31+08:00\">\n\t\t\t\t05/18/2025\t\t\t</time>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-content\">\n\t\t\t<h3 id=\"title-2\" class=\"grve-post-title grve-heading-color grve-h3\" itemprop=\"headline\">WordPress 古腾堡编辑器中文字类区块使用说明</h3>\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>默认情况下（WordPress 6.8.1+ Twenty Twenty-F​​ive 主题），古腾堡编辑器包含多个区块类型，主要分为文字、媒体、设计、小工具、主题、嵌入和其他未分类区块等类别。每个类别中的区块都有其独特…</p>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<a class=\"grve-read-more grve-link-text\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/website/wordpress-gutenberg-text-blocks/\"><span>阅读全文</span>\t\t\t\t<svg width=\"40px\" height=\"16px\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 16\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-line\" points=\"0 7 38 7 38 9 0 9\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-point\" points=\"31.3481912 0 40 8 31.3481912 16 30 14.5816219 37.1 8 30 1.41837809\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t</svg>\n\t\t\t</a>","link":"https://www.shephe.com/website/wordpress-gutenberg-text-blocks/","retrieved":1747590243605},{"title":"认识 WordPress 古腾堡编辑器：界面与功能板块","contents":"<a class=\"grve-item-url\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/website/wordpress-gutenberg-editor/\" rel=\"bookmark\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">认识 WordPress 古腾堡编辑器：界面与功能板块</span></a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-media\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-media-inner grve-radius-none grve-shadow-none\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-back